  "body": "Properties with this much character and charm rarely come to market.\r\nThis striking cedar home is a true standout in Castor Bay. Elevated, north-facing and bathed in all-day sun, it captures fabulous sea views and offers a level of privacy and tranquillity that's increasingly hard to find. Inside, the heart timber chapel ceilings lend a warmth and grandeur that sets this home apart from anything else on the market.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this property special:\r\n•  Designed for living and entertaining: The clever 'U'-shaped layout wraps around sunny decks and a private courtyard, creating seamless indoor-outdoor flow. Enjoy the spa, dine alfresco, or simply soak up the peaceful bush outlook and birdsong.\r\n•  Space for every occasion: Separate formal and casual living areas, 3-4 bedrooms including a beautifully renovated ground-floor master ensuite, a separate dining room and office, plus a bonus attic/rumpus room above the garage - ideal as a work-from-home space or teenager's retreat.\r\n•  Secure and practical: Electronic gates, ample off-street parking, and room for the boat or caravan.\r\n•  Unbeatable location: Close to several popular beaches, vibrant Milford village with its trendy cafés and restaurants, and walking distance to Pupuke Golf Course and coastal walkways.\r\n•  Zoned for excellence: Campbells Bay Primary and Westlake Boys & Girls - some of the best schools on the North Shore.\r\n•  Bonus opportunity: Zoned Mixed Housing Suburban on a freehold 987m2 site, there's genuine development potential here to explore (subject to council approval) - a rare find in this sought-after location.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n•  3-4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 living areas\r\n•  3 toilets plus separate office/study\r\n•  Freehold 987m2, north/west facing with sea and bush views\r\n•  Secure electric gates, spa pool, manicured grounds\r\n•  Campbells Bay Primary & Westlake zone\r\n•  Castor Bay beach just down the road\r\n\r\nThis is a home that must be experienced to be fully appreciated. Whether you're searching for a family haven, a lifestyle upgrade, or a smart land-banking opportunity, 16 Braemar Road delivers on every level.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
